    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Swordsman</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Swordsman is a <strong>fast-paced hack and slash</strong> game set in a <strong>2.5D side-scrolling</strong> dark fantasy world. Take control of a skilled swordsman and battle against relentless waves of enemies. With its dynamic combat mechanics, strategic skill selection, and craftable gear system, every playthrough offers a fresh challenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Fast-Paced and Fluid Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Swordsman, you can combine <strong>light and heavy attacks</strong> to execute deadly combos, utilizing various abilities to defeat enemies. The combat system is designed to test your <strong>reflexes and strategic thinking</strong> in intense battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy waves become increasingly difficult, and at certain levels, you\u2019ll face <strong>powerful boss fights</strong> that push your skills to the limit. Time your attacks wisely, dodge incoming strikes, and master the art of combat to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546900/extras/bdaaf2e30a4c5f5671aaa1244cf18de6.poster.avif?t=1752172831\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546900/extras/bdaaf2e30a4c5f5671aaa1244cf18de6.webm?t=1752172831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546900/extras/bdaaf2e30a4c5f5671aaa1244cf18de6.mp4?t=1752172831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Skill Progression Through Card Choices</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you level up, you\u2019ll be presented with <strong>three random cards</strong>, each offering a new ability. If you choose the same card again in future selections, that skill <strong>levels up and becomes stronger</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different combinations to <strong>adapt your ability</strong> and create devastating synergies to annihilate your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546900/extras/b318e4ed25258015b9b3f5b17ff85499.poster.avif?t=1752172831\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546900/extras/b318e4ed25258015b9b3f5b17ff85499.webm?t=1752172831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546900/extras/b318e4ed25258015b9b3f5b17ff85499.mp4?t=1752172831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Blacksmith and Equipment Crafting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you battle through hordes of enemies, you\u2019ll collect materials that can be used at the <strong>blacksmith</strong> to forge <strong>new swords, armor, and equipment</strong>. These upgrades will enhance your character\u2019s abilities and help you progress further in each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death is not the end! While your level resets upon dying, any <strong>collected equipment and crafted items remain</strong>, allowing you to become stronger with each attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546900/extras/f26dc4e240f4aba4433c926aa5c3b324.poster.avif?t=1752172831\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546900/extras/f26dc4e240f4aba4433c926aa5c3b324.webm?t=1752172831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546900/extras/f26dc4e240f4aba4433c926aa5c3b324.mp4?t=1752172831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>New Levels, New Enemies</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546900/extras/08711b89f7ca52ff410f095c50808169.poster.avif?t=1752172831\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546900/extras/08711b89f7ca52ff410f095c50808169.webm?t=1752172831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
